    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lui̱k Yecu mi jiääk kɛ kui̱ ŋi̱eec ŋuɔ̱tni kɛnɛ ji̱ Pa-ri-thii",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Yecu bua̱n nath kɛnɛ ji̱ kɔaarɛ jiök i̱, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ŋi̱eec ŋuɔ̱tni kɛnɛ ji̱ Pa-ri-thii tekɛ kɛ lua̱ŋ mi latkɛ luɔt ŋuɔ̱tni Muthɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inɔ, la̱tdɛ kä nhɔakɛ tin diaal tin la̱rkɛ yɛ, kä /cuarɛ lät ni tin lät kɛn kɛ. Kɛ ɣöö /ca tin ŋi̱i̱c kɛn kɛ lät. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛn yiankɛ ɣa̱c ti thiak thiaak, ti bɛc ka̱pdiɛn, kä kuëŋkɛ wuɔ̱ɔ̱kni nɛɛni ti kɔ̱ŋ, kä kɛn pua̱nykiɛn /cikɛn kɛ luäk kɛ ka̱pdiɛn nhial. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛn la̱tkɛ nyinkiɛn diaal kɛ ɣöö ba kɛ nɛn ɛ naath, kɛ ɣöö la̱tkɛ wäl tin ca ruac Kuɔth gɔ̱a̱r thi̱n a di̱t, kä jakɛ dhuɔɔr thuk bieyni palädiɛn kä bär. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä nhɔakɛ gua̱th luthä, mi nyuurkɛ guäth mi̱thni kɛnɛ kɔamni tin gɔw ɛlɔ̱ŋ rɛy gua̱thni palä ji̱ Juudh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä nhɔk kɛn neri nhiam nath kɛnɛ ɣöö bakɛ cɔl i̱ ‘ŋi̱eec’ ɛ naath. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä yɛn /ca yɛ bi cɔl i̱ ‘ŋi̱eec’, kɛ ɣöö ŋi̱i̱cdun ɛ kɛl, kä yɛn diaal lapɛ dämani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä a thil ram mi cɔl yɛnɛ i̱ ‘gua̱a̱ra’ wi̱i̱ muɔ̱ɔ̱n, kɛ ɣöö Guurun ɛ kɛl, ɛ jɛn min te nhial. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä a yɛ /ca cɔl i̱ ‘bööth’, kɛ ɣöö bo̱o̱thdun ɛ kɛl, ɛ jɛn Mɛ-thia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ram in di̱t ni jɛn rɛydun bɛ a läätdun. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ram mi jak rɔɔdɛ kä di̱t ba jɛ luɔ̱c piny, kä ram mi jak rɔɔdɛ kä kuiy ba jɛ kuëŋ nhiam.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kuëth Yecu kɛ ciaaŋ mɛɛtädiɛn",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Riɛk akɛ yɛ, yɛn ji̱ gɔ̱rä kɛnɛ yɛn ji̱ Pa-ri-thii, kɛ yɛn ji̱ mɛɛtdä! Kɛ ɣöö gäk yɛn naath raar kuäärä nhial. Kɛ ɣöö /ci yɛn wä rɛc, kä /cia jɛ nhɔk ɛn ɣöö bi nɛy kɔ̱kiɛn wä rɛc. [ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Riɛk akɛ yɛ, yɛn ji̱ gɔ̱rä kɛnɛ Pa-ri-thii, kɛ yɛn ji̱ mɛɛtdä! Kɛ ɣöö macɛ duël mään jɔɔkni kä latdɛ la̱ŋ ti ba̱a̱r ba̱a̱r kɛ ca̱p nyuthä, kɛ kui̱ ɛmɔ bi yɛn kuëth mi di̱t ni jɛn jek].",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23:14",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Tha̱a̱ŋ buɔkni kä buɔkni tëë wal thilɛ jɛ thi̱n.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Riɛk akɛ yɛ, yɛn ji̱ gɔ̱rä kɛnɛ yɛn ji̱ Pa-ri-thii, kɛ yɛn ji̱ mɛɛtdä! Yɛn jiathɛ bar kä ja̱lɛ mun kɛ ɣöö bia ram kɛl jak kä ri̱i̱tdɛ rɔ ciɛŋädun, kä mi cia jɛ jek ɛn ram ɛmɔ, bia jɛ cu jak kä ram mi jiääk mi ro̱ŋ kɛ gua̱a̱th maac mi leny ni yɛ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Riɛk akɛ yɛ, yɛn bööth ti ciöör, tin larkɛ jɛ i̱, ‘Mi yaac raan rɔɔdɛ kɛ luaak Kuɔth, thilɛ mi yiɛɛn jɛ. Kä duundɛ ɣöö mi yaac raan rɔɔdɛ kɛ da̱a̱p luaak Kuɔth, jɛn bɛ min cɛ lar la̱t.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yɛn nɛy ti ciöör ti dɔ̱a̱a̱r! Ɛŋadiɛn di̱t ni jɛn ɔ, ɛ da̱a̱p kiɛ ɛ luaak Kuɔth in jak da̱a̱p kä rɛl rɔ? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ruac yɛn i̱, ‘Mi yaac raan rɔɔdɛ kɛ yi̱kä, thilɛ mi yiɛɛn jɛ. Kä mi yaac raan rɔɔdɛ kɛ muc in cɛ ka̱m Kuoth wi̱i̱ yi̱kä, bɛ min cɛ lar la̱t.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku yɛn la nɛy ti ciöör i̱di? Ɛŋadiɛn di̱t ni jɛn ɔ, ɛ muc kiɛ ɛ yi̱k in jak muc kä lɛy lɛy ɔ? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä inɔ ram mi yaac rɔɔdɛ kɛ yi̱k, a jɛ, yaac rɔɔdɛ kɛ jɛ kɛnɛ ŋɔak diaal tin te thi̱n. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ram mi yaac rɔɔdɛ kɛ luaak Kuɔth, a yaac rɔɔdɛ kɛ jɛ kɛnɛ ram in cieŋ thi̱n. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ram mi yaac rɔɔdɛ kɛ nhial, a jɛ yaac rɔɔdɛ kɛ kɔm kuäärä Kuɔth kɛnɛ ram in nyuur thi̱n.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
