            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Riɛk akɛ yɛ, yɛn ji̱ gɔ̱rä kɛnɛ Pa-ri-thii, kɛ yɛn ji̱ mɛɛtdä! Kɛ ɣöö ka̱mɛ Kuoth wa̱l wa̱a̱li nanani kɛnɛ wal kɔ̱kiɛn, kä pa̱lɛ tin di̱t ni kɛn kä ŋuɔ̱t, thuɔ̱k kɛnɛ kɔ̱a̱c lɔaac kɛ ŋa̱th. Gɔaa ni mi cia ti̱ti̱ la̱t, a thil päl kɛ tin kɔ̱kiɛn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yɛn bööth ti ciöör, la yɛn burbur a thiiy, kä ba̱tdɛ thɔ̱rɔ̱l!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
