            "sid": "MAT 23:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Riɛk akɛ yɛ, yɛn ji̱ gɔ̱rä kɛnɛ yɛn ji̱ Pa-ri-thii, kɛ yɛn ji̱ mɛɛtdä! Kɛ ɣöö yɛn lakɛ jɔk lirä kɛnɛ jɔk thaak, kä thiäŋ rɛydiɛn kɛ mac kɛnɛ da̱r kɛ cam jiic. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ji̱n Pa-ri-thii mi cɔr! Kɔŋni lak ni rɛy lirä, kɛ ɣöö bi jɔkdɛ cu puath bä.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Riɛk akɛ yɛ, yɛn ji̱ gɔ̱rä kɛnɛ yɛn ji̱ Pa-ri-thii, yɛn ji̱ mɛɛtdä! Kɛ ɣöö ce̱t yɛn kɛ kɔ̱a̱k kunyä ti ca rɔth kɛ buɔ̱yɛ mi bo̱r, bi rariɛn kula duŋ gɔaa, kä thiäŋ rɛydiɛn kɛ cɔ̱w nɛɛni tin ci li̱w kɛnɛ jia̱k jia̱a̱k diaal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mäni yɛn bä, jɔc rarun kɛ ciaŋ cuŋni kä naath, kä thiäŋ rɛydun kɛ mɛɛt kɛnɛ nyuɔɔn.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ma̱r Yecu kɛ ɣöö bi Kuoth ji̱ gɔ̱rä kɛnɛ ji̱ Pa-ri-thii duäc",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Riɛk akɛ yɛ, yɛn ji̱ gɔ̱rä kɛnɛ yɛn ji̱ Pa-ri-thii, yɛn ji̱ mɛɛtdä! Kɛ ɣöö ta̱thɛ kɔ̱a̱k kunyä göökni agɔaa, kä jakɛ muɔ̱ɔ̱n ji̱ cuŋni kä gɔw guec biɛɛlikiɛn, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kä larɛ jɛ i̱, ‘Mi canɛ tëk guäth ëëdan ëë te gua̱ndɔɔŋnikɔn thi̱n, /canɛ rɔ̱ dee mat kɛ näk göökni.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä inɔ ci yɛn ɛ lat pa̱ny ɛn ɣöö kɛ yɛn gaat nɛɛni tëë ca göök näk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä inɔ cuɔ̱pɛ jiäk guurikun. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yɛn thɔ̱ɔ̱l! Yɛn dɛy thɔ̱ɔ̱li! Bia kään i̱di kä yorun maac mi thil pek? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ kui̱ ɛmɔ ɣän ja̱kä göök kä yɛ kɛ nɛy tin pɛl kɛ ji̱ gɔ̱rä, kä bia tha̱a̱ŋkiɛn näk, kä bia tha̱a̱ŋkiɛn pua̱t jiɛn, kä bia tha̱a̱ŋkiɛn duäc gua̱thni palädiɛn, kä bia kɛ guɔ̱ɔ̱r wec ɔ kɛ wec ɔ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ kui̱c ɛmɔ bi riɛm ji̱ cuŋni diaal in ci lo̱ny piny wi̱i̱ muɔ̱ɔ̱n a wi̱cdun, nikä riɛm raam mi thil duer ni E-bɛl amäni riɛm Dhɛ-kar-yaa gat Ba-ra-kia mi cia näk kam duëël palä kɛnɛ yi̱k Kuɔth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛpuc, ɣän la̱rä jɛ yɛ, bi mɛmɛ kɛɛliw pɛn wi̱i̱ ri̱cä mɛmɛ.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Pa̱r Yecu kɛ Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aɣ, Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm, Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm! Ji̱n mi näk göök kä bo̱k nɛy tëë ci Kuoth kɛ jäkä ji̱! Kɛ gua̱th da̱ŋ di ti cä go̱r ɛn ɣöö dee gaatku kul, ce̱tkɛ min la rol manpalɛ̈k dɛykɛ kɛ gɔ̱kɛ, kä /ka̱nɛ jɛ nhɔk! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nɛnɛ, ciëëŋdu ba jɛ ba̱ny piny ni baaŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 23:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ɣän la̱rä jɛ yɛ, /cia ɣä bi nyɔk kɛ nën, amäni mi wiaa jɛ lar i̱, ‘Puɔ̱th akɛ ram mi bëë kɛ ciöt Kua̱r ni Kuoth.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.23.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.23.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
